                    {
                        "form_id": "1324b3cb-a730-43b2-8f1d-4d98cfa6d082",
                        "entry_id": "1aec8b70-24b4-3db4-bd49-34cb27eaaa9b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "квинтэссе́нциях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3b283699-0ca0-3bd3-a1c3-6a0c981a873e",
                        "entry_id": "1aec8b70-24b4-3db4-bd49-34cb27eaaa9b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "истор. в натуральной философии Аристотеля — эфир, тончайший вид материи (наряду с водой, воздухом, землёй и огнём)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1490abca-35b3-3b5f-bd3a-d31ff1cbf0ab",
                        "entry_id": "1aec8b70-24b4-3db4-bd49-34cb27eaaa9b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "то, что является самым главным, самым существенным; основа, суть чего-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1bf576c2-1d3d-4626-aa62-f8947e100663",
                                "sense_id": "1490abca-35b3-3b5f-bd3a-d31ff1cbf0ab",
                                "text": "Не будет преувеличением сказать, что перед нами — квинтэссенция мудрости и творчества людей, которые переместили камни по 200-километровому маршруту из одной провинции в другую."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1ad0212d-b822-440b-9f46-7d0f1a47331a",
                                "sense_id": "1490abca-35b3-3b5f-bd3a-d31ff1cbf0ab",
                                "text": "Это был сплав всего моего балетного опыта, квинтэссенция нерастраченной энергии и ночей глухого отчаянья, тоски по танцу и постояннного ужаса от сознания нереализованных возможностей."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6f94165b-402c-40ed-bd20-c8481356bcdf",
                        "source_entry_id": "1aec8b70-24b4-3db4-bd49-34cb27eaaa9b",
                        "source_sense_description": "эфир",
                        "target_lang_word": "quintessence",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "quintessence",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eccf973c-6881-3707-b4ec-5a877c1f655c",
                                        "entry_id": "d45c4657-a86c-33bf-883f-a5ba2c6a1118",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A thing that is the most perfect example of its type; the most perfect embodiment of something; epitome, prototype."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee5ef65c-bb9e-4809-87d7-171ea97067b8",
                                                "sense_id": "eccf973c-6881-3707-b4ec-5a877c1f655c",
                                                "text": "As families and kindreds sometimes do; producing, after long ages of unnoted notability, some living quintescence of all the qualities they had, to flame forth as a man world-noted […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "73dfed6e-78a1-3df2-9963-c9c65fdcf89b",
                                        "entry_id": "d45c4657-a86c-33bf-883f-a5ba2c6a1118",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A pure substance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e0365268-f572-3bfb-a058-8e99126a4c3e",
                                        "entry_id": "d45c4657-a86c-33bf-883f-a5ba2c6a1118",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The essence of a thing in its purest and most concentrated form."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "caa3b382-7933-484e-af7a-90b64c5c8153",
                                                "sense_id": "e0365268-f572-3bfb-a058-8e99126a4c3e",
                                                "text": "For vvhat is ſilke but eu'n a Quinteſſence, / Made vvithout hands beyond al humane ſenſe? / A quinteſſence? nay vvel it may be call'd, / A deathleſſe tincture, ſent vs from the skies, / VVhoſe colour ſtands, vvhose gloſſe is ne're appalld, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "024217a5-1fdd-4f7b-bf8d-fc0f9384d2d8",
                                                "sense_id": "e0365268-f572-3bfb-a058-8e99126a4c3e",
                                                "text": "Let ther be Light, ſaid God, and forthwith Light, / Ethereal, firſt of things, quinteſſence pure, / Sprung from the Deep, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "47324e77-4d1f-336c-b69b-2fba2495d8ef",
                                        "entry_id": "d45c4657-a86c-33bf-883f-a5ba2c6a1118",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The fifth alchemical element, or essence, after earth, air, fire, and water that fills the universe beyond the terrestrial sphere."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "559bfded-cd2e-3f86-91a3-c5a8a81d1873",
                                        "entry_id": "d45c4657-a86c-33bf-883f-a5ba2c6a1118",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A hypothetical form of dark energy postulated to explain observations of an accelerating universe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "quintessence",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f8f378ad-8974-36a6-b01a-8fb7bd4db798",
                                        "entry_id": "8012334c-fb20-327e-bb3d-ff72cb20fd23",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To reduce to its purest and most concentrated essence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1b517c8b-a7f5-4ced-8e6a-86b28e655685",
                        "source_entry_id": "1aec8b70-24b4-3db4-bd49-34cb27eaaa9b",
                        "source_sense_description": "эфир",
                        "target_lang_word": "quintessence",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "quintessence",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "47e8fb7b-f6c7-31d9-8a1d-076bfd8c558f",
                                        "entry_id": "adfef423-6aa3-3442-a5c8-5b9405d6313b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Cinquième élément, qui s’ajoute chez les philosophes anciens aux quatre premiers (la terre, le feu, l’air, l’eau) et qui en assure la cohésion ou la vie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c076cd19-2f7d-4168-b0ff-c2265d7fd15f",
                                                "sense_id": "47e8fb7b-f6c7-31d9-8a1d-076bfd8c558f",
                                                "text": "Posidonius, Cléanthe, la tiennent [l’âme] pour la chaleur, Hippocrate pour un esprit répandu dans tout l’être […] Zénon pour la quintessence des quatre éléments, Héraclide de Pont pour la lumière."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7fa536c1-adf6-36fe-bb0b-57862b2faaef",
                                        "entry_id": "adfef423-6aa3-3442-a5c8-5b9405d6313b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Partie la plus subtile extraite de quelques corps, essence, éther."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75aa25e4-ea2c-487b-8fe3-5dad05e8cc99",
                                                "sense_id": "7fa536c1-adf6-36fe-bb0b-57862b2faaef",
                                                "text": "Ce sont le soleil et la lune de source mercurielle et origine sulfureuse qui, par le feu continuel, s’ornent d’habillements soyeux, pour vaincre étant unis, et puis changés en quintessence, toute chose métallique, solide, dure et forte."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7972ba59-632c-456d-a6a8-5f339f1f4a25",
                                                "sense_id": "7fa536c1-adf6-36fe-bb0b-57862b2faaef",
                                                "text": "Toutes les formes d'amour, de souffrance, de folie ; il cherche lui-même, il épuise en lui tous les poisons, pour n'en garder que les quintessences."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d44879f-f050-4a1a-84cc-83325e596512",
                                                "sense_id": "7fa536c1-adf6-36fe-bb0b-57862b2faaef",
                                                "text": "Quintessence d’absinthe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18a924c0-9d9f-417b-83a1-6be43ccd8656",
                                                "sense_id": "7fa536c1-adf6-36fe-bb0b-57862b2faaef",
                                                "text": "Abstracteur de Quinte Essence."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fc1b73a6-d40d-3912-a8fc-c617dc17a30d",
                                        "entry_id": "adfef423-6aa3-3442-a5c8-5b9405d6313b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Essence, concentré."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "340ca6e9-a198-48c5-ab02-72e58aa3596c",
                                                "sense_id": "fc1b73a6-d40d-3912-a8fc-c617dc17a30d",
                                                "text": "Jetez dans le restant de la sauce […] un peu de quintessence de jambon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba81820a-680c-3145-beb8-7ed5be03f9c2",
                                        "entry_id": "adfef423-6aa3-3442-a5c8-5b9405d6313b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ce qu’il y a de principal, de plus précieux, de plus caché dans une affaire, dans un discours, dans un livre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a8ef3c7-0ac3-4bba-a301-f7a4497a40e4",
                                                "sense_id": "ba81820a-680c-3145-beb8-7ed5be03f9c2",
                                                "text": "J’ai tiré la quintessence de cet ouvrage."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ac03f20d-dde0-3d0d-8328-33c87408ca21",
                                        "entry_id": "adfef423-6aa3-3442-a5c8-5b9405d6313b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ce qu’il y a de plus fin, d’essentiel, de meilleur dans une chose ou chez une personne."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e43c32bd-8961-4db1-8704-8b5e8ec72037",
                                                "sense_id": "ac03f20d-dde0-3d0d-8328-33c87408ca21",
                                                "text": "L’amour est la quintessence de la réalité, de Dieu, de la matière."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "509092bc-6c2d-38e4-8d47-efa6fdfc7ee9",
                                        "entry_id": "adfef423-6aa3-3442-a5c8-5b9405d6313b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Forme subtile, épurée, abstraite, éthérée."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e145eccc-285e-4e4b-a2d4-45ca5e12a40b",
                                                "sense_id": "509092bc-6c2d-38e4-8d47-efa6fdfc7ee9",
                                                "text": "Le néo-impressionniste sublime la sensation recueillie pour en éliminer les détails accessoires […] ; il ne reste qu’une quintessence."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b45410f5-2add-3f5e-a25c-497c789738c5",
                                        "entry_id": "adfef423-6aa3-3442-a5c8-5b9405d6313b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Forme hypothétique d’énergie noire, proposée comme explication aux observations de l’accélération de l’expansion de l’univers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
